#HELPS
1 ALD VELOTHI~
Ald Velothi is a modest Redoran harbor village along the coast north of Gnisis
where poor traders, a smith and watchful guards serve its few weathered homes.
A fortified watchtower watches the sea as Ashalmawia rises on the eastern hill
and an outcast Ashlander camp rests on high ground south of the village.~
